# one-for-one -- running `nargo execute witness` in that sibling crate against
# its own example reproduces exactly the prev_hash values below for the first 4
# (real) headers. Verified via a real nargo compile/execute + bb prove/verify pass
# (real Poseidon2 sponge, std::hash::poseidon2_permutation) before committing these
# numbers -- real, measured cost at this exact fixture:
# circuit/reanchoring/RESULTS_MAXN_PADDING.md.
